{
  "format": "spreadsheet-app",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Inventory Movements & Reorder Desk",
  "pages": [
    {
      "name": "Inventory",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Stock overview",
          "source": "# Inventory and reorder desk\n\nStock comes from receipts, usage, and signed count adjustments. Open reservations reduce what is available to promise. The count-check table keeps physical counts beside the movement-derived balance so discrepancies stay visible.\n\n{% let reorder = COUNTIF(Inventory[ReorderStatus], \"Reorder\") %}\n**{{ reorder }}** items need a purchase review. The gloves and M3 bolts have open reservations; the carton count is two below the movement ledger.\n\nUse the form to record a receipt or usage. Quantity is positive for those movements. A count adjustment may be positive or negative. Item choices come from the inventory list."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "name": "Inventory",
          "rowCount": 4,
          "colCount": 9,
          "columns": [
            {
              "name": "ItemID",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "Item",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "Supplier",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ReorderAt",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "name": "Unit",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "OnHand",
              "type": "formula",
              "formula": "=SUMIFS('Movement history'!Movements[NetQty],'Movement history'!Movements[ItemID],[ItemID])"
            },
            {
              "name": "Reserved",
              "type": "formula",
              "formula": "=SUMIFS('Movement history'!Reservations[Quantity],'Movement history'!Reservations[ItemID],[ItemID],'Movement history'!Reservations[Status],\"Open\")"
            },
            {
              "name": "Available",
              "type": "formula",
              "formula": "=[OnHand]-[Reserved]"
            },
            {
              "name": "ReorderStatus",
              "type": "formula",
              "formula": "=IF([Available]<[ReorderAt],\"Reorder\",\"OK\")"
            }
          ],
