    {
      "name": "Count checks",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Count review",
          "source": "# Physical count review\n\nCountCheck compares a physical count with movements through the count date. A nonzero variance is a follow-up item; post an adjustment only after confirming the count and the movement history.\n\n{% let open = COUNTIF(CountCheck[FollowUp], \"Investigate\") %}\nThere are **{{ open }}** count discrepancies to review. The carton record is short by two units."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "name": "CountCheck",
          "rowCount": 4,
          "colCount": 6,
          "columns": [
            {
              "name": "CountDate",
              "type": "date"
            },
            {
              "name": "ItemID",
              "type": "choice",
              "choicesFrom": {
                "page": "Inventory",
                "table": "Inventory",
                "column": "ItemID"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "PhysicalCount",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "name": "SystemCount",
              "type": "formula",
              "formula": "=SUMIFS('Movement history'!Movements[NetQty],'Movement history'!Movements[ItemID],[ItemID],'Movement history'!Movements[Date],\"<=\"&[CountDate])"
            },
            {
              "name": "Variance",
              "type": "formula",
              "formula": "=[PhysicalCount]-[SystemCount]"
            },
            {
              "name": "FollowUp",
              "type": "formula",
              "formula": "=IF([Variance]=0,\"OK\",\"Investigate\")"
            }
          ],
